the objects and data RGBMatrixFX passes to a plugin through them, to the extent they are
documented there.

"Independent Plugin" means a work that
  (a) is loaded and run by RGBMatrixFX's plugin loader,
  (b) interacts with RGBMatrixFX only through the Plugin API, and
  (c) is not based on RGBMatrixFX: it contains no part of RGBMatrixFX other than what section 2(a)
