Using the names, signatures, constants and data formats of the Plugin API, to the extent
needed to interoperate with it, does not by itself make a work based on RGBMatrixFX. An
Independent Plugin may also use other libraries (including Qt for Python / PySide6)
directly, as long as it reaches RGBMatrixFX itself only through the Plugin API.

"Combined Work" means RGBMatrixFX running together with one or more Independent Plugins, for
example in the same process.


